難易度Gでも 全て壊してみせる
even with difficulty G, I'll break it all down.

224
00:20:20,052 --> 00:20:23,952
ギリギリmind 更なるGへと
Limitless mind, towards even greater heights,

225
00:20:24,152 --> 00:20:29,952
意識が溶ける 体は制御不能 行っちまうかもね
consciousness melts, the body is uncontrollable, I might just go over.

226
00:20:30,952 --> 00:20:34,952
限界点なら 塗り替えていい
If it's the limit point, it's okay to rewrite it.

227
00:20:35,152 --> 00:20:38,852
破壊と再生から 私が出来る
From destruction and rebirth, I can create myself.

228
00:20:49,132 --> 00:20:51,632
ふざけ合った友達と
With friends joking around,

229
00:20:51,632 --> 00:20:54,332
求め合ったあの人と
and that person we sought each other with,

230
00:20:54,332 --> 00:20:56,832
また会える日のために
for the sake of meeting again one day,

231
00:20:56,832 --> 00:21:01,832
ギラギラしてるよ
shining brightly.

232
